														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4857012">
									

<p>A few things. One is the copious amount of red, its a bit jarring and seems very unnecessary so I would cut that if I were you. Two, this thing isn't Apollyon. It is inevitable yes, but its not going to end the world, and its effects can be easily contained by supressing AI research into the field of music and not letting people listen. Also I feel that there has to be a better reason for it to be an &quot;anomaly,&quot; constants in AI happen all of the time and I don't see why this one is any different. I also don't see why the SCP number is censored, as as far as I could tell the article had no mention of the need to censor that. That ties in to another issue I had, with the Department of Miscommunications. That feels just tacked on, and it serves no narrative purpose. Right now I am downvoting, but this thing has potential I think.</p>

