<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><span style="font-size:125%;"><a href="/scp-3476">SCP-3476 - A Place to Sever Stranded Heartstrings // Gabriel's Fountain</a></span></p>
<p><em>&quot;The news of his death put a lot of baggage on my shoulders. How was I supposed to live up to the legacy of a self-made millionaire and owner of the biggest business in Oregon?&quot;</em></p>
</div>
<hr />
<p>A mysterious place within a lonely town of Oregon. Something has&#8230; changed it, made it something more than what it used to be. What happened? Why has it been abandoned? Come take a read and find out for yourself! (Please mind the Content Warning.)</p>
<blockquote>
<p><em>&quot;This&nbsp;is a delightfully disturbing real-feeling story.&quot;</em> - <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1581620&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609287632" alt="DarkStuff" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1581620)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/darkstuff" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1581620); return false;">DarkStuff</a></span></p>
